inline const TCHAR* Name(int T){if(T>=70&&T<80){static const TCHAR* N[]={TEXT("NEW YORK STATE FAIRGROUNDS"),TEXT("NIAGARA MOHAWK BUILDING"),TEXT("THE PALACE THEATRE"),TEXT("SYRACUSE UNIVERSITY"),TEXT("CARRIER DOME"),TEXT("CLINTON SQUARE"),TEXT("ONCENTER WAR MEMORIAL"),TEXT("EMPOWER FCU AMPHITHEATER AT LAKEVIEW"),TEXT("ONONDAGA LAKE"),TEXT("SYRACUSE CITY BLOCK")};return N[T-70];}if(T==68)return TEXT("HIGHMARK STADIUM");if(T==69)return TEXT("DESTINY USA");if(T>=64&&T<68){static const TCHAR* N[]={TEXT("FORT ASHCROFT"),TEXT("AMERICAN RESERVE BANK"),TEXT("RICHARDSON SHOOTING CLUB"),TEXT("TRAILBOUND SPORTING GOODS")};return N[T-64];}if(Expanded(T)){static const TCHAR* N[]={TEXT("GRAND MERIDIAN SHOPPING MALL"),TEXT("IRONVALE STATE PRISON"),TEXT("SAINT BRIGID CHURCH"),TEXT("SUNSET MOTOR COMPANY"),TEXT("BUILDRIGHT HARDWARE"),TEXT("WONDERLAND THEME PARK")};return N[T-ShoppingMall];}if(T==53)return TEXT("DEEPWELL SURVIVAL BUNKER");if(T==54)return TEXT("FRACTURE CAVERNS");if(T==55)return TEXT("INTERSTATE SERVICE TUNNELS");if(T==56)return TEXT("LIBERTY RESIDENTIAL TOWER");if(T==57)return TEXT("MERIDIAN MEDICAL TOWER");if(T==32)return TEXT("RICHARDSON INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT");if(LWLandmarks::Unique(T))return LWLandmarks::Get(T).Name;if(LWDungeons::IsDungeon(T))return LWDungeons::Profile(T).Name;if(T==21)return TEXT("THE GILDED REPUBLIC RESORT");if(T==20)return TEXT("RICHARDSON FINANCIAL TOWER");if(T==Tavern)return TEXT("THE LAST LANTERN");static const TCHAR* N[]={TEXT("FUEL STOP"),TEXT("MOTEL"),TEXT("CLINIC"),TEXT("DEPOT"),TEXT("DINER"),TEXT("ARCADE"),TEXT("APARTMENTS"),TEXT("RANCH HOUSE"),TEXT("COTTAGE"),TEXT("TOWNHOUSE"),TEXT("MEGAMARKET"),TEXT("CROSSROADS PLAZA"),TEXT("HOMEWORKS FURNITURE"),TEXT("WAREHOUSE"),TEXT("FAST FOOD"),TEXT("DRIVE-IN THEATER"),TEXT("PARKING LOT"),TEXT("POLICE STATION"),TEXT("VANTA ATELIER"),TEXT("THE LAST LANTERN")};return N[FMath::Clamp(T,0,Tavern)];}
inline const TCHAR* Event(int T){if(T>=70)return T==74||T==76?TEXT("stadium"):TEXT("landmark");if(T==68)return TEXT("stadium");if(T==69)return TEXT("mall");if(T>=64&&T<68){static const TCHAR* N[]={TEXT("military"),TEXT("bank"),TEXT("range"),TEXT("sports")};return N[T-64];}if(Expanded(T)){static const TCHAR* N[]={TEXT("mall"),TEXT("prison"),TEXT("church"),TEXT("dealership"),TEXT("hardware"),TEXT("themepark")};return N[T-ShoppingMall];}if(Underground(T))return TEXT("underground");if(T==56||T==57)return TEXT("tower");if(T==32)return TEXT("airport");if(LWLandmarks::Unique(T))return TEXT("landmark");if(LWDungeons::IsDungeon(T))return TEXT("dungeon");if(T==21)return TEXT("casino");if(T==20)return TEXT("tower");if(T==Tavern)return TEXT("tavern");static const TCHAR* N[]={TEXT("gas"),TEXT("motel"),TEXT("clinic"),TEXT("depot"),TEXT("diner"),TEXT("arcade"),TEXT("apartments"),TEXT("house"),TEXT("house"),TEXT("house"),TEXT("market"),TEXT("mall"),TEXT("furniture"),TEXT("warehouse"),TEXT("fastfood"),TEXT("drivein"),TEXT("parking"),TEXT("police"),TEXT("boutique"),TEXT("tavern")};return N[FMath::Clamp(T,0,Tavern)];}
inline const TCHAR* Loot(int T){if(T>=64&&T<68)return TEXT("depot");if(Expanded(T))return T==Church?TEXT("clinic"):T==ShoppingMall||T==ThemePark?TEXT("diner"):TEXT("depot");if(Underground(T))return TEXT("depot");if(T==57)return TEXT("clinic");if(LWDungeons::IsDungeon(T))return T==23||T==28?TEXT("clinic"):TEXT("depot");return T==2?TEXT("clinic"):T==0?TEXT("gas"):T==3||T==13||T==17?TEXT("depot"):T==4||T==10||T==14||T==Tavern?TEXT("diner"):TEXT("motel");}
inline FVector2D Size(int T){if(T>=70&&T<80){static const FVector2D V[]={{140000,140000},{6300,2700},{2700,5600},{5800,3200},{19000,16000},{6500,10000},{10600,8000},{16000,17000},{1200,1200},{3000,3000}};return V[T-70];}if(T==68)return {62000,58000};if(T==69)return {100000,65000};if(T>=64&&T<68){static const FVector2D V[]={{11000,11000},{5200,7400},{4800,8600},{6200,6200}};return V[T-64];}if(Expanded(T)){static const FVector2D Sizes[]={{18000,15000},{12000,12000},{4400,5600},{8000,7200},{8000,6800},{20000,18000}};return Sizes[T-ShoppingMall];}if(Underground(T))return {2400,2200};if(T==56||T==57)return {3600,3200};if(T>=32&&T<53)return LWLandmarks::Size(T);if(LWDungeons::IsDungeon(T))return LWDungeons::Size(T);switch(T){case 21:return {12000,18800};case 20:return {3600,3200};case Tavern:return {2400,2000};case 0:return {2200,1800};case 1:return {3000,2200};case 2:return {2400,2200};case 3:case 13:return {4400,3600};case 5:return {2600,2200};case 6:return {3600,2800};case 7:return {2000,1800};case 8:return {2400,2200};case 9:return {3200,2200};case 10:return {6400,4400};case 11:return {7200,5000};case 12:return {6800,4800};case 15:return {7000,7000};case 16:return {5400,4000};case 17:return {3800,3000};case 18:return {3600,3000};default:return {2400,2000};}}
